Description: fingerprint login settings for the MATE desktop
 A Vala and GTK 3 utility to enrol and delete fingerprints and to enable or
 disable fingerprint authentication on the MATE desktop. It talks to fprintd
 over D-Bus and toggles its PAM profile through PolicyKit and
 pam-auth-update.
 .
 A fingerprint reader supported by libfprint is required.
